flowchart LR
    A[Distilled Record Candidate] -->|Pydantic schema validation| B[Typed MemoryRecord]
    B -->|TTL policy| TTL{record_ttl / LEARNKIT_PERSIST_FOREVER}
    TTL -->|persist-forever| B0[expires_at = None - never expires]
    TTL -->|default| B1[expires_at = now + TTL_DEFAULTS by type]
    B0 --> C{Record type}
    B1 --> C

    C -->|skill/fact/strategy/preference/heuristic| D[status quarantine]
    C -->|failure/trace| E[status active]

    D -->|maintain_memory promote_quarantined after min hours| F[status active]
    E --> F

    F -->|retrieval usage successful| G[reinforce confidence/reuse_count]
    F -->|retrieval usage harmful| H[demote confidence]
    H -->|harmful hits threshold| I[status quarantine]

    F -->|TTL expired AND maintain aggressive| J[status stale]
    J -->|maintenance decay or revive by update| K[may return active]

    F -->|consolidation merge losers - opt-in| L[status deprecated]

    subgraph MAINT[maintain_memory - non-destructive by default]
        M1[promote_quarantined - always]
        M2[decay / mark_expired_stale - only when aggressive]
        M3[consolidate - opt-in]
    end

    G --> M[(Backend records row)]
    I --> M
    J --> M
    L --> M
    B0 --> M

